{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FwruP96Tg81793197683.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>商務部長王文濤指歐盟近期的措施，對中歐產生負面影響。</p><p></p><p>王文濤會見歐洲議會國際貿易委員會主席朗格時表示，中方注意到歐盟近期密集推動出台一系列經貿限制工具，對中歐產供鏈穩定，以及雙方企業合作產生負面影響。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EU-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261ONLRA0Ngc1793197700.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>王文濤強調，中國不是歐盟問題的根源，而是解決問題的夥伴，希望歐方與中方相向而行。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:15.315839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.329742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:25.486294+00:00","content_hash":"1bd3f8c09bfe20e269b1e4d0d53d6891563f119877362483f46ecfd7a22af2db","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:15.315839+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}